Package: athena-installer-data
Package-Type: udeb
Section: debian-installer
Architecture: all
Depends:
Description: Athena installer-side data files
 Static data files needed by the Debian Installer ramdisk to run
 against an Athena ISO: stub debconf templates that upstream udebs
 we don't ship would otherwise provide, release-identity files
 (/etc/lsb-release, /etc/default-release), the debootstrap suite
 script for Athena's codename, and a tasksel wrapper that strips
 DEBIAN_TASKS_ONLY=1 so derivative task descriptions surface on
 the Software-selection menu.
 .
 This package is built from local source under fork/source/ and
 ships only static files — no compiled code, no runtime logic
 beyond a small postinst that wires the tasksel wrapper via
 dpkg-divert.
